<title>UK: Enterprise ups production forecast for '99.</title>
<headline>Enterprise ups production forecast for '99.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Enterprise Oil Plc said on Thursday it expected production to rise to 320,000 barrels of oil equivalent per day (boepd) in 1999 after it increased three percent last year to 242,932 boepd.</p>
<p>Enterprise, which earlier reported a 40 percent increase in 1996 profit after tax, had previously forecast 1999 production of about 300,000 boepd.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
